  "body": "Using the latest ART from github on Xubuntu 26.04. \n\nWith a raw file opened, when I activate Lens correction profiles > Auto from database, I do not see any change in the image. Activating the option Manual via database, the Camera and Lens dropsdowns stay gray, ie. I can't choose my camera or lens. \n\nDoing the same in RawTherapee, I see a slight shift of the photo, it always worked like that. \n\nIf I remember well, this used to work the same in ART. \n\nIs it possible that I miss some kind of libraries, like LibRaw of Lensfun? \n\nOr is the thing just broken? \n\nRegards, Paul. ",
